  "excludes": "Runtime environments, caches including .gitnexus, pyc, .DS_Store, and this manifest itself.",
  "scope": "Prepared sources and deliveries, including native Motion Canvas full film and portable editorial pass (motion shots, collected handoffs, editor returns). Pass two adds the self-contained Signal example and generic verification. Pass three adds local status/resume, shot intent, timecoded notes, draft animatics, and bounded SVG revision previews. Pass four adds Motion Canvas shot registration, collected handoff packaging, and read-only editor-return comparison. Existing Unit 9 outputs are preserved."
